<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 10px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 20px; }
        .button { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #007bff; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; }
        .footer { text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #777; margin-top: 20px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h2>MFA Reset Approved</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello,</p>
            <p>Your request to reset your Multi-Factor Authentication has been <strong>approved</strong>.</p>
            <p>Please click the button below to complete the reset and disable your current MFA setup. You will be prompted to re-enroll upon your next login.</p>
            <p style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
                <a href="{{resetUrl}}" class="button">Complete MFA Reset</a>
            </p>
            <p>If you did not request this, please contact support immediately.</p>
            <p>This link will expire in 24 hours.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated message from the Agentic CMS System.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
